      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This has been requested a few times before.\n\nMost users when asked are against the idea, and for good reason.\nIf you are a streamer it makes you a target, and if you're not then you have to deal with people using it as a meaningless accolade similar to trust rank. The difference being that trust rank serves a real purpose.\n\nThe only way a streamer badge could work is if it appears to friends only, was optional, and unobtrusive. Like a purple dot on their profile picture in your friends list and a live symbol on the profile.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
