      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Any badge or prestige for having popularity almost anywhere results in a frenzy to be the first or one of a number of people to obtain it, while it is a neat idea, it would attract unwanted attention and behavior to the wrong people. \nI can see what you mean by \"not be in the internet without knowing\" in a sense, however, it is extremely difficult for an app to know when it is being streamed, and people behave differently when they know they are being recorded.",
      "viewerReactions": null
